WEBVTT

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:08.450
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:14.960
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:16.790
It's my day!

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:27.370
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:34.780
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:42.150
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:49.560
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:55.330
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.830 --> 00:01:02.470
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.640 --> 00:01:09.980
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.680 --> 00:01:16.120
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:16.120 --> 00:01:19.190
I just want to walk

00:01:19.520 --> 00:01:22.730
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.960 --> 00:01:26.700
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.660 --> 00:01:35.600
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:42.040
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:44.310
It's my day!

00:02:02.930 --> 00:02:06.300
<i>I take back everything I ever did
or said to you.</i>

00:02:07.700 --> 00:02:09.940
<i>Don't ever talk to me again.</i>

00:02:20.280 --> 00:02:23.620
<i>Nothing you say can stop me
from making him mine.</i>

00:02:27.590 --> 00:02:30.190
<i>There's no turning back now.</i>

00:02:30.890 --> 00:02:34.360
<i>I'll do as Domyoji said,
and forget anything happened.</i>

00:02:43.570 --> 00:02:52.420
"A Bewildering First Date!"

00:02:57.450 --> 00:03:00.890
Tsukushi, why are you all dressed up?
Got a date?

00:03:01.220 --> 00:03:03.040
Yes. I'm going out for a while.

00:03:03.040 --> 00:03:05.790
Really? With Domyoji?

00:03:06.090 --> 00:03:08.610
Well, isn't that just grand?!

00:03:08.610 --> 00:03:10.630
No, not him.

00:03:11.430 --> 00:03:13.140
Not him? Then, who?

00:03:13.140 --> 00:03:15.970
Tell me. With who? With who?

00:03:16.400 --> 00:03:18.790
You're not stringing
two boys along, are you?

00:03:18.790 --> 00:03:19.870
Who is it?

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:22.410
Leave me alone!

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:25.150
It's Hanazawa!
Do you have a problem with that?

00:03:25.150 --> 00:03:26.280
Nope!

00:03:27.980 --> 00:03:31.900
Is he the only son of
the president of Hanazawa Trading?

00:03:31.900 --> 00:03:34.200
Wow! Dear!

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:37.130
She'll be marrying into
a fortune no matter who she picks!

00:03:37.130 --> 00:03:39.140
Good for you, Tsukushi!

00:03:39.140 --> 00:03:43.630
Dear, she'll be marrying into
a fortune! A fortune! Hurray!

00:04:00.310 --> 00:04:01.580
Hello...

00:04:02.710 --> 00:04:03.710
Been waiting long?

00:04:05.520 --> 00:04:08.450
N-no... I just got here.

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:12.060
Rui Hanazawa... Your hair!

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:16.930
Oh, I cut it yesterday.
It was getting too long.

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:19.370
It looks great on you!

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:23.400
It was nice long,
but this short style suits you.

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:28.200
Don't go on about it.
It's embarrassing.

00:04:30.510 --> 00:04:31.840
<i>My...</i>

00:04:32.640 --> 00:04:34.940
<i>He has such nice features.</i>

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:39.880
<i>Domyoji's handsome too,
but that hairstyle is laughable.</i>

00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:45.750
<i>What am I thinking?
Forget all about him!</i>

00:04:46.090 --> 00:04:48.270
<i>I'm going to have fun on this date.</i>

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:51.360
Where are we going, Rui Hanazawa?

00:04:51.730 --> 00:04:53.600
Is there anywhere 
special you want to go?

00:04:54.930 --> 00:04:57.270
No... What about you?

00:04:58.400 --> 00:05:00.140
No... me either...

00:05:17.720 --> 00:05:19.390
Now, it's my turn.

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:23.520
I wonder what that is...

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:29.960
How about now?!

00:05:30.500 --> 00:05:32.100
That's nothing!

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:36.970
Is this a game?

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:42.210
It tells fortunes, too. Looks fun.

00:05:43.580 --> 00:05:46.710
<i>But I'm almost through this month's
allowance already...</i>

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:50.850
I'll take this.

00:05:51.480 --> 00:05:53.420
I'm so happy! Thank you!

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:56.290
I'll keep it forever and ever!

00:05:56.590 --> 00:05:58.990
Don't make such a big deal out of a toy.

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:03.060
<i>It's my first gift from Rui Hanazawa.</i>

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:05.730
<i>I'd even treasure a pebble from him.</i>

00:06:06.130 --> 00:06:07.130
I know!

00:06:07.870 --> 00:06:09.870
I'll let this tell us where to go.

00:06:12.370 --> 00:06:15.270
Rui Hanazawa, put your finger here.

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:26.860
Ocean

00:06:24.520 --> 00:06:26.860
A date at the ocean?

00:06:30.090 --> 00:06:31.390
Wow!

00:06:39.660 --> 00:06:42.170
There are places like this
even in Tokyo?

00:06:52.880 --> 00:06:55.910
<i>Rui Hanazawa hasn't said a word.</i>

00:06:56.750 --> 00:06:58.650
<i>I should say something...</i>

00:06:59.750 --> 00:07:03.150
<i>but there's something about him
that's making me tense.</i>

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:24.510
<i>I never thought dating could
be so nerve-wracking.</i>

00:07:28.680 --> 00:07:30.010
Look over there!

00:07:31.280 --> 00:07:33.940
Isn't that where Shizuka's poster was?

00:07:33.940 --> 00:07:35.280
That takes me back!

00:07:39.290 --> 00:07:43.030
<i>Yes, and this is where
Rui Hanazawa kissed it.</i>

00:07:43.530 --> 00:07:45.490
<i>So tenderly...</i>

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:49.400
<i>The whole scene looked like a painting.</i>

00:07:50.470 --> 00:07:52.570
Shizuka was so pretty.

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:53.840
Makino...

00:07:55.170 --> 00:07:57.890
Would you please not talk about Shizuka?

00:07:58.240 --> 00:08:02.710
Oh, I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm so sorry!

00:08:03.180 --> 00:08:05.410
<i>I'm so thoughtless!</i>

00:08:05.710 --> 00:08:08.120
You don't have to apologize so much.

00:08:09.550 --> 00:08:12.550
<i>Oh! What a fool I am!</i>

00:08:14.960 --> 00:08:19.760
This is the first time
 I've gone out with a girl.

00:08:20.330 --> 00:08:22.560
I was always with those three...

00:08:30.170 --> 00:08:32.570
I'm sorry if I'm boring.

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:38.250
Rui Hanazawa...

00:08:39.980 --> 00:08:43.780
Now that I think about it,
they're the only friends I had.

00:08:44.990 --> 00:08:47.190
Of course, it's the same for them.

00:08:49.790 --> 00:08:52.860
You've got a better personality
than any of the F4.

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:55.000
You'll make friends in no time.

00:08:55.730 --> 00:08:58.200
After all, birds of an F4 flock together.

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:01.170
Not bad!

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:03.520
I think I deserve a prize!

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:04.570
What for?

00:09:05.210 --> 00:09:10.100
Huh? Well, you see... I took the F4, and...

00:09:10.100 --> 00:09:11.200
Oh, a pun...

00:09:12.650 --> 00:09:15.970
<i>Yikes. I guess he 
doesn't get jokes like this.</i>

00:09:18.580 --> 00:09:21.150
Listen... Rui's fine.

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:25.420
You always call me by my full name.

00:09:26.090 --> 00:09:27.160
Just call me Rui.

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:32.530
Umm... Then, I'd better practice.

00:09:33.270 --> 00:09:33.970
Rui!

00:09:35.400 --> 00:09:36.700
Rui, Rui!

00:09:38.500 --> 00:09:40.270
Don't call me for no reason.

00:09:41.070 --> 00:09:43.640
Let me try it again. Rui?

00:09:43.640 --> 00:09:45.110
<i>Rui...</i>

00:09:50.420 --> 00:09:51.850
<i>Forget it, forget it!</i>

00:09:57.990 --> 00:09:59.070
Ouch...

00:09:59.070 --> 00:10:01.160
Are you all right?

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:03.800
<i>Boy, is this embarrassing...</i>

00:10:04.900 --> 00:10:06.160
I'm okay.

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:07.770
Uh, Hanaza...

00:10:10.640 --> 00:10:13.510
<i>Oh, come on! Yell at me or something!</i>

00:10:13.510 --> 00:10:16.570
<i>There's nothing as embarrassing
as going through this alone.</i>

00:10:20.710 --> 00:10:22.950
Oh... What happened to your nose?

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:25.420
I had a little accident.

00:10:26.450 --> 00:10:27.520
Oh...

00:10:32.160 --> 00:10:33.650
<i>If it were him...</i>

00:10:34.160 --> 00:10:38.220
<i>S-stupid! What the hell are you doing?</i>

00:10:39.230 --> 00:10:41.640
<i>Oh well, then... Hold on to me.</i>

00:10:41.640 --> 00:10:44.320
<i>No thanks! My arm would rot.</i>

00:10:45.800 --> 00:10:49.570
<i>You're the only one
I'll let speak to me like that!</i>

00:10:51.440 --> 00:10:56.410
<i>We walked together that morning,
down the snowy Omotesando.</i>

00:10:57.910 --> 00:11:01.780
<i>He had waited four hours for me,
in the snow.</i>

00:11:02.650 --> 00:11:04.850
<i>He had snow on his head.</i>

00:11:05.890 --> 00:11:09.510
<i>Since then, I began to notice
his feelings for me.</i>

00:11:09.510 --> 00:11:12.060
<i>But I pretended not to see.</i>

00:11:12.900 --> 00:11:18.260
<i>Now I know... Just how much
he felt for me.</i>

00:11:18.870 --> 00:11:23.540
<i>And just how much I hurt him.</i>

00:11:27.010 --> 00:11:28.010
Makino.

00:11:30.510 --> 00:11:31.980
<i>Oh, geez...</i>

00:11:32.780 --> 00:11:34.850
Just daydreaming...

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:48.000
I-I'll go and buy us some french fries, too.

00:11:52.700 --> 00:11:54.100
<i>Why is this happening?</i>

00:11:55.100 --> 00:11:57.870
<i>Why do I keep thinking about Tsukasa?</i>

00:11:58.470 --> 00:12:01.410
<i>I just told myself I'd forget
everything about him!</i>

00:12:06.300 --> 00:12:10.150
<i>Yes... Rui Hanazawa asked me out
for the first time.</i>

00:12:13.990 --> 00:12:15.310
<i>That kiss...</i>

00:12:25.670 --> 00:12:27.100
<i>I'm here.</i>

00:12:27.970 --> 00:12:32.770
<i>His cool hand on mine made me
so happy I could die.</i>

00:12:35.540 --> 00:12:36.810
<i>Oh, the lock!</i>

00:12:42.780 --> 00:12:44.980
Oh, were you in here?

00:12:45.920 --> 00:12:47.420
You should lock the door.

00:12:54.060 --> 00:12:56.730
He saw me!

00:13:20.490 --> 00:13:22.650
Quit crying, will you?

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:27.830
B-but... You saw me...

00:13:29.160 --> 00:13:31.600
Let me get this straight.
It wasn't my fault.

00:13:31.960 --> 00:13:34.430
It was your fault for not locking the door.

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:38.660
It's no big deal. Everyone poops.

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:42.440
I wasn't pooping, I was peeing!

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:49.830
<i>No...</i>

00:13:49.830 --> 00:13:51.380
<i>This is awful!</i>

00:13:54.720 --> 00:13:58.020
Funny. You're really funny!

00:13:59.460 --> 00:14:00.960
I like you even more.

00:14:04.560 --> 00:14:06.530
Let's go somewhere where
we can be alone.

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:26.580
Quit following me!

00:14:28.280 --> 00:14:32.910
What's with you,
tailing me all morning!

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:34.150
I'll slap you!

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:38.030
Well, I started wondering
how you were doing,

00:14:38.030 --> 00:14:40.360
and I just couldn't sit still.

00:14:46.370 --> 00:14:51.670
Quit acting so girly!
Girls like you give me the creeps.

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:58.680
Don't think you can can fool a guy
with an act like that. Moron!

00:14:59.380 --> 00:15:01.480
So you prefer
someone like Makino?

00:15:01.480 --> 00:15:04.900
Then, I'll become more like her!

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:08.820
I'll walk like a guy and laugh out loud.

00:15:09.190 --> 00:15:11.090
Then, would you...?

00:15:12.530 --> 00:15:16.200
If you ever mention her name
in front of me again,

00:15:17.030 --> 00:15:19.400
I'll fix it so no amount of
plastic surgery will help you.

00:15:23.500 --> 00:15:27.110
Wow! What in the world is
this behind this gate?

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:29.110
It looks like a mansion 
from a samurai flick.

00:15:29.980 --> 00:15:32.330
"What in the world"?
It's my home.

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:34.080
Sorry it looks like a set.

00:15:37.650 --> 00:15:39.250
This is amazing!

00:15:39.620 --> 00:15:44.190
I didn't know anyone lived in houses
like this anymore.

00:15:44.720 --> 00:15:47.530
Well, it's not mine. It's my dad's.

00:15:48.660 --> 00:15:50.560
There's nothing great about it.

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:53.970
You're so humble, Rui Hanazawa.

00:15:54.430 --> 00:15:56.070
<i>This is how Domyoji would act...</i>

00:15:56.070 --> 00:15:59.040
Domyoji

00:15:56.070 --> 00:15:59.040
How do you like it?
This is <i>my</i> house.

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:00.500
Isn't it great?

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:05.340
A peon like you rarely ever
sees a house like this!

00:16:05.340 --> 00:16:07.850
Well, his house <i>is</i> really grand.

00:16:11.150 --> 00:16:13.150
<i>There I go again...</i>

00:16:16.890 --> 00:16:17.890
I'm home.

00:16:18.760 --> 00:16:20.760
Welcome home, Master Rui.

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:24.160
Oh, a guest?

00:16:24.600 --> 00:16:27.330
H-hello...

00:16:27.770 --> 00:16:32.170
It's unusual for Master Rui to
bring anyone besides Miss Shizuka.

00:16:38.310 --> 00:16:41.550
Oh... What a simple room!

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:46.180
Sit on the bed. The floor is too cold.

00:16:46.850 --> 00:16:48.120
O-okay...

00:16:56.690 --> 00:16:59.230
<i>Am I asking for trouble?</i>

00:16:59.730 --> 00:17:03.800
<i>I doubt he'd do it, but what if
he decides to push me down...</i>

00:17:05.500 --> 00:17:07.070
How about looking at...

00:17:08.470 --> 00:17:09.440
...some albums?

00:17:10.440 --> 00:17:12.310
A-albums?

00:17:13.710 --> 00:17:14.980
Yes! I'd love to!

00:17:16.780 --> 00:17:20.980
How cute! This looks like
a mini Rui Hanazawa.

00:17:22.050 --> 00:17:25.250
Domyoji! He looks like trouble.

00:17:26.590 --> 00:17:30.760
Say, was Nishikado 
girl-crazy even back then?

00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:35.160
Mimasaka looks very different today.

00:17:37.900 --> 00:17:39.100
<i>Shizuka...</i>

00:17:40.470 --> 00:17:43.570
<i>She was a part of the group
from this early age.</i>

00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:49.040
<i>And Rui has liked her ever
since they were little.</i>

00:17:50.280 --> 00:17:53.620
<i>I... I could never compete
with such a long history.</i>

00:17:54.450 --> 00:17:57.790
<i>It's only natural... And I knew all along...</i>

00:17:58.220 --> 00:18:00.960
<i>I can never call him just "Rui"
like Shizuka does.</i>

00:18:03.490 --> 00:18:06.490
<i>Wait a minute! What's going on?</i>

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:09.100
Rui Hanazawa! I'm not...!

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:15.770
<i>Huh? He's asleep...</i>

00:18:20.140 --> 00:18:23.440
<i>For Pete's sake! I'm such a fool.</i>

00:18:41.830 --> 00:18:45.100
<i>He looks like an angel, sleeping there.</i>

00:19:08.920 --> 00:19:13.230
Would you please cover him up?
I'm going home.

00:19:13.230 --> 00:19:14.830
My! Master Rui...

00:19:23.470 --> 00:19:25.870
How long are you gonna follow me?

00:19:25.870 --> 00:19:27.410
Go on home!

00:19:27.710 --> 00:19:29.940
But I love you!

00:19:30.310 --> 00:19:32.380
I have, ever since I was little...

00:19:35.280 --> 00:19:39.130
Don't you remember an ugly little girl...

00:19:39.130 --> 00:19:41.520
...telling you she loved you when
you were in elementary school?

00:19:50.090 --> 00:19:51.960
<i>Ugly, ugly, ugly dog!</i>

00:20:00.300 --> 00:20:02.740
That... was me...

00:20:03.570 --> 00:20:06.520
You? You were that kid?

00:20:10.450 --> 00:20:14.420
Do you know how it feels to be
called names by someone you love?

00:20:18.160 --> 00:20:24.730
After my plastic surgery in Germany,
I swore vengeance.

00:20:25.730 --> 00:20:30.230
I'd make you fall madly in love with me,
then dump you. But...

00:20:31.970 --> 00:20:38.410
When I saw you at Eitoku,
I realized that I still loved you.

00:20:39.580 --> 00:20:43.980
When I look at you, I feel like
I'm looking at myself.

00:20:45.310 --> 00:20:47.580
That's a warped way of
expressing affection...

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:58.230
<i>Rui Hanazawa was 
probably tense from doing
something he wasn't used to.</i>

00:20:58.760 --> 00:21:02.040
<i>So was I. I'm exhausted.</i>

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:04.970
It's creepy, huh?

00:21:05.670 --> 00:21:06.770
You're right.

00:21:10.440 --> 00:21:13.910
<i>Domyoji! 
Why's he talking to Sakurako?</i>

00:21:14.440 --> 00:21:15.880
You should always be like that.

00:21:16.340 --> 00:21:18.210
Huh? Be like what?

00:21:19.350 --> 00:21:21.750
Just be natural.

00:21:22.350 --> 00:21:23.700
Don't be so girly.

00:21:26.820 --> 00:21:30.180
Just who is being "girly"?! You jerk!

00:21:30.180 --> 00:21:31.200
How's that?

00:21:31.630 --> 00:21:33.550
Yes. That's more like it.

00:21:33.550 --> 00:21:34.400
Oh, my...

00:21:38.870 --> 00:21:40.400
<i>Why are they laughing?</i>

00:21:48.410 --> 00:21:52.110
<i>That... That was where I belonged!</i>

00:22:05.630 --> 00:22:11.700
You let your hair down a little

00:22:13.670 --> 00:22:19.570
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:21.340 --> 00:22:29.450
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:29.680 --> 00:22:37.490
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:37.490 --> 00:22:45.260
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:45.530 --> 00:22:53.400
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:45.530 --> 00:22:53.400
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:53.400 --> 00:23:01.780
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:53.400 --> 00:23:01.780
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:03.580 --> 00:23:11.560
Do you really hate me this time?

00:23:11.560 --> 00:23:19.330
Will you end up running to him?

00:23:19.600 --> 00:23:27.500
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:23:19.600 --> 00:23:27.500
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:27.500 --> 00:23:35.910
I can say "I love you"...

00:23:27.500 --> 00:23:35.910
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:23:47.660 --> 00:23:48.730
What a beauty!

00:23:48.860 --> 00:23:53.260
I thought she looked familiar...
She's Domyoji's sister!

00:23:54.030 --> 00:23:56.530
I'm not supposed to see Domyoji.

00:23:56.870 --> 00:24:00.570
But his sister has brought me
to their home!

00:24:01.000 --> 00:24:03.610
I've got to get out of here!

00:24:04.170 --> 00:24:07.010
Next on Hana Yori Dango:
"The Arrival of Tsubaki Domyoji!"

00:24:07.610 --> 00:24:09.710
I have no right to see him.
